   "widgets_values": [
    "RTX VFX POST PIPELINE (Nvidia VFX Nodes - Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_Nvidia_VFX_Nodes - P10 item 4, 2026-10-24).",
    "Chain: VHS_LoadVideo -> RTXVideoSuperResolution (2x ULTRA) -> RTXVideoFrameGeneration (x2 MEDIUM = 24->48 fps slow-mo)",
    "       -> RTXTrueHDR (HLG, 1000 nits peak, DL-Debander ON) -> VHS_VideoCombine (48 fps).",
    "Requires: pack installed in custom_nodes (cloned) + nvidia-vfx bindings (pip) + ComfyUI restart (restart gate).",
    "Torch 2.12.0+cu130 already matches the cu130 requirement. RTX 5090 OK (40-series+ for frame gen).",
    "SR quality modes: BICUBIC/LOW/MED/HIGH/ULTRA + DENOISE_*/DEBLUR_*/HIGHBITRATE_*/STREAMING_* (same-res clean-up).",
    "HDR output = normalized RGB WITHOUT color metadata - for true HDR delivery encode H.265 + HDR flags (switch VHS format).",
    "For plain upscaling only: bypass 203/204 (wire 202 -> 205, frame_rate 24).",
    "Blog: blog.comfy.org/p/nvidia-vfx-nodes-for-video-upscaling (full pipeline + EXR 16/32-bit improvements).",
    "NOT run (D192)."
   ]
  }
